# ==========================================================================
# DATA PRIVACY — UK Biobank is controlled-access. NEVER commit individual-
# level records. The patterns below exclude all raw inputs and every
# per-sample derived matrix. Aggregate figures and summary tables are kept.
# ==========================================================================

# Raw inputs (UK Biobank modality files)
data/

# Per-sample derived matrices (rows = participants). DO NOT publish.
# Covers imputed/z-scaled matrices, OOF probabilities, the stacked OOF,
# the z-scaled CSVs (metabolomics_z, biochem_z, diet_z), and fitted R models.
# Note: gitignore does not support trailing comments, so each pattern stands alone.
*.parquet
*_z.csv
*.rds

# Re-create these locally by running the pipeline against your own data/.

# Auto-generated reader's-guide codebook (regenerable build artifact; still
# contains course-specific framing). Excluded from the public repo for now —
# can be cleaned and re-included later if wanted as a portfolio artifact.
analysis/Phase_A_codebook.ipynb
analysis/_build_codebook.py

